{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688630/extras/830cf23af84522394bba22ec68cc41ac.avif?t=1765182891\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc96 <strong>Heart Idler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heart Idler</strong>\u00a0is a  clicker/idle game where you start with nothing and build your way up to a vast collection of hearts! Click to generate hearts, invest them in powerful upgrades, and watch your heart count soar. Can you unlock all the upgrades and achieve the ultimate collection of hearts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688630/extras/23f94d5f16680475c0a0bb9bde56da7d.avif?t=1765182891\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f <strong>Click to Generate Hearts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Start with zero hearts and click hearts that fly out to get more hearts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688630/extras/d0b6652bec88d78f86a8eb66e4e409e8.avif?t=1765182891\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b06\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade &amp; Automate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spend your hearts on a variety of upgrades to increase your heart production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688630/extras/2525c4437c127d262626dff4029818f8.avif?t=1765182891\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udecc <strong>Idle Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Earn hearts even when you're not actively playing. Come back to a wealth of hearts and new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688630/extras/dbd665ec389379c65ee5ff011639ac9e.avif?t=1765182891\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Unlock Skins &amp; Cosmetics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Customize your game by unlocking new heart skins, backgrounds and colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688630/extras/6bf181349ff097ae9f2915af24d9aee3.avif?t=1765182891\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728<strong>Cute Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy Cute, colorful graphics make every click satisfying as you grow your heart collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688630/extras/fc63cbf9bb8997a8ec16eb7334f2c708.avif?t=1765182891\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There's always one more upgrade, one more skin, and one more milestone to hit. How many hearts can you collect?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc97 <strong>Join the Heart Collecting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart Idler is perfect for fans of satisfying clickers, relaxing idle games, and delightful cosmetic progression. Jump in and see how far your love of hearts can take you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688630?t=1765182891","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688630/0a7ed183404e00ccaf8170982d0627edb5054dde/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765182891","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as